1
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,640
[EP12]

2
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:40,900
What do you mean?

3
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:42,040
Simply put,

4
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,020
someone wants to kill you.

5
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:44,920
Huh.

6
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:46,640
You don't believe me.

7
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,720
Why are you telling me this?

8
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:51,400
Don't you believe Chu Nanfeng

9
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:52,820
and think I destroyed the Su family?

10
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:55,360
Because I've already guessed

11
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:56,900
the Old Marshal is no longer alive,

12
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:59,440
And your uncle is impersonating him.

13
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:00,620
You are indeed very smart.

14
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:01,780
Yes.

15
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:03,340
My father is dead.

16
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,100
It was your father who killed him.

17
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:06,440
An eye for an eye.

18
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:07,320
Do you believe it?

19
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,740
My father killed your father.

20
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:11,280
The Su family is the right arm of the Ling family.

21
00:01:11,540 --> 00:01:12,340
Destroying the Su family

22
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:13,420
means the Ling family will lose an arm.

23
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:14,820
Now I'm poisoned,

24
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,640
and someone in your mansion poisoned you.

25
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,460
Doesn't all this have anything to do with your father's death?

26
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:21,300
Don't you want us to work together to find out the truth?

27
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,900
I will find out the truth.

28
00:01:26,820 --> 00:01:27,860
But I don't need you.

29
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,180
You still don't believe me.

30
00:01:33,020 --> 00:01:34,300
But I will prove to you

31
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:36,380
that I am your most trustworthy partner.

32
00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:40,120
My Lady,

33
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,380
this is the freshly heated milk.

34
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:42,620
Have a good rest.

35
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,160
My Lady,

36
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,700
have you noticed

37
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:50,340
that the servants in the mansion

38
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,780
have been changing frequently lately?

39
00:01:53,220 --> 00:01:55,520
Auntie Wang, who was cleaning the front yard yesterday,

40
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,160
is nowhere to be seen today.

41
00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,280
Even

42
00:01:58,280 --> 00:02:00,740
the personal maids around Second Concubine

43
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:02,440
have been replaced with new faces.

44
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:04,080
Who arranged this?

45
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,040
I don't know.

46
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:07,360
Recently,

47
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:08,400
everyone is in danger.

48
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:10,480
The servants dare not speak much.

49
00:02:10,580 --> 00:02:12,760
Yesterday, when I went to the kitchen,

50
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:15,220
I heard two old ladies talking

51
00:02:15,220 --> 00:02:16,620
that the cenotaph is not right.

52
00:02:16,620 --> 00:02:19,160
And they disappeared yesterday afternoon.

53
00:02:19,860 --> 00:02:20,660
I see.

54
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,020
You can go now.

55
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,280
[It seems that Ling Shenxing]

56
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:31,140
[pretends not to believe me,]

57
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:33,080
[but his actions are honest.]

58
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:34,760
[He has already started investigating]

59
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:36,040
[who is poisoning.]

60
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:41,880
[Why did Ling Shenxing suddenly change my maid?]

61
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,720
[Could it be...]

62
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:44,700
Second Concubine,

63
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,640
you've been busy all day

64
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:48,340
and haven't even had a sip of hot tea.

65
00:02:48,740 --> 00:02:49,740
Please take a rest.

66
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:51,740
I'll get you a bowl of bird's nest soup.

67
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:52,700
It's fine.

68
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:53,800
No need.

69
00:02:54,540 --> 00:02:55,340
You should get some rest too.

70
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,660
This was just given to me

71
00:02:58,900 --> 00:03:00,000
by a gentleman to give to you.

72
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:08,360
Remember,

73
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:09,980
no one can enter

74
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,660
without my permission.

75
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:12,580
Yes, ma'am.

76
00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:19,080
Sir?

77
00:03:20,380 --> 00:03:21,720
[Who could it be?]

78
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:27,000
[Who wrote that note?]

79
00:03:27,140 --> 00:03:28,400
[He must know something.]

80
00:03:35,700 --> 00:03:37,600
[If Ling Shenxing finds out anything,]

81
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:40,320
[what will happen]

82
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:42,520
[to the baby?]

83
00:03:43,140 --> 00:03:44,160
[I need to make other plans.]

84
00:03:53,780 --> 00:03:55,180
Someone!

85
00:03:59,220 --> 00:04:00,040
Willow.

86
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,600
Willow.

87
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,400
Willow.

88
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:06,820
Madam,

89
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:08,300
the midwife said Second Concubine is having a difficult labor.

90
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,280
They are at their wits' end.

91
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:12,680
It's okay, it should be fine.

92
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:16,340
Jinrou, Jinrou said she knows traditional Chinese medicine.

93
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,460
She should be fine.

94
00:04:18,180 --> 00:04:19,620
She should be fine.

95
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,400
Please,

96
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,380
save my child.

97
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:35,040
Concubine,

98
00:04:35,220 --> 00:04:35,960
don't worry,

99
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:36,920
I'm here.

100
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:40,220
She's been in pain all night.

101
00:04:40,540 --> 00:04:41,520
Please, Miss Ye,

102
00:04:41,820 --> 00:04:43,520
save her.

103
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:50,700
She's bleeding heavily.

104
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:52,440
We need a lot of hot water.

105
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,140
Go get it.

106
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:54,560
Now!

107
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:00,660
Jinrou,

108
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:04,320
if you can pull through this

109
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,120
and save the Ling family's heir,

110
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,220
I'll make a decision.

111
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:09,580
Tomorrow I'll announce to the whole city

112
00:05:09,820 --> 00:05:11,540
that you have done a great service to us.

113
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,960
I'll marry you into the Ling residence

114
00:05:14,300 --> 00:05:15,660
as the young madam.

115
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:19,360
Madam,

116
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:20,380
don't worry.

117
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:21,900
I'll try my best.

118
00:05:29,780 --> 00:05:30,840
Su Muwan,

119
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:32,120
the Second Concubine is in danger.

120
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,220
Don't you want to save her?

121
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,200
Hang in there!

122
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:34,960
Save her!

123
00:05:35,340 --> 00:05:37,060
Do you have the ability to do that?

124
00:05:37,620 --> 00:05:38,400
Don't forget

125
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,600
the last patient died in the end.

126
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:42,420
Was that her fault?

127
00:05:43,140 --> 00:05:44,000
Don't listen to her.

128
00:05:44,580 --> 00:05:45,160
Su Muwan,

129
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,180
you are a doctor.

130
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:53,060
I didn't know

131
00:05:53,980 --> 00:05:55,580
you were so close to her.

132
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,380
Even if you have a grudge,

133
00:05:57,940 --> 00:05:59,060
two lives are at stake.

134
00:06:00,700 --> 00:06:01,560
As a human being,

135
00:06:02,540 --> 00:06:04,100
I hope the baby is born safely.

136
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,140
This is the bottom line.

137
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,680
Her condition is not good.

138
00:06:10,460 --> 00:06:11,140
She's bleeding.

139
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:14,320
Young Marshal,

140
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:15,740
the Old Madam wants to see you.

141
00:06:18,180 --> 00:06:18,920
I'll go with you.

142
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:19,820
Okay.

143
00:06:23,060 --> 00:06:24,040
Come here.

144
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:27,600
Madam.

145
00:06:33,980 --> 00:06:34,800
Just say it.

146
00:06:35,500 --> 00:06:36,860
Second Madame's bleeding doesn't stop.

147
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:39,000
Three doctors have been invited, but it doesn't work.

148
00:06:39,020 --> 00:06:40,440
We've tried acupuncture and medicine.

149
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,580
If it goes on like this,

150
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,220
the baby may be lost.

151
00:06:43,420 --> 00:06:45,520
And her pulse is getting weaker.

152
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:46,400
Oh my!

153
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,320
What should we do?

154
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:48,300
Go to the hospital

155
00:06:48,420 --> 00:06:49,020
and see a western doctor.

156
00:06:49,740 --> 00:06:50,280
No way!

157
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,640
The hospital is full of people

158
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:56,040
from all walks of life.

159
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:58,700
How could a Ling family's concubine go there

160
00:06:58,700 --> 00:06:59,940
and be seen naked?

161
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,300
What if she gets

162
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:02,220
an infectious disease?

163
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:04,060
If the news gets out,

164
00:07:05,060 --> 00:07:05,840
what will happen

165
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,140
to our reputation?

166
00:07:09,660 --> 00:07:10,500
Ling Shenxing,

167
00:07:10,740 --> 00:07:12,960
are you tired of being disciplined?

168
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:15,680
You disregard our family rules!

169
00:07:17,900 --> 00:07:18,980
The Second Concubine fainted.

170
00:07:19,380 --> 00:07:20,480
Her pulse is barely detectable.

171
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:26,120
Oh my!

172
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:27,100
What should we do?

173
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:28,940
Oh my!

174
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:30,820
Amitabha!

175
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:31,960
Please bless us!

176
00:07:32,140 --> 00:07:32,560
Young Marshal,

177
00:07:33,380 --> 00:07:34,380
the doctor went out to see patients.

178
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:35,580
He won't be back for four hours.

179
00:07:38,900 --> 00:07:39,360
Grandma,

180
00:07:39,620 --> 00:07:40,300
let's go to the hospital.

181
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,060
I'll take full responsibility.

182
00:07:42,540 --> 00:07:44,600
Can you?

183
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:46,120
What kind of place is the hospital?

184
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:47,620
It's a mixed bag.

185
00:07:48,100 --> 00:07:49,940
There are no decent female doctors,

186
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:51,320
only male doctors.

187
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:54,100
Do you want your second aunt

188
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,920
to be seen by a male doctor?

189
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,680
Do you want your

190
00:07:57,700 --> 00:08:00,140
unborn brother to lose dignity?

191
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:03,200
You unfilial and disloyal thing!

192
00:08:03,860 --> 00:08:06,180
Do you even have your father in your eyes?

193
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,360
You're unworthy of being a son!

194
00:08:09,100 --> 00:08:09,660
Guards!

195
00:08:10,700 --> 00:08:12,920
Take him to the ancestral tablets

196
00:08:13,140 --> 00:08:13,600
and make him kneel!

197
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:20,400
Sister, I believe in you.

198
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,580
I'll save...
